Note: this is limited to the first 100 entities in the markdown string.

Ex:
renderedMarkdown(markdownString: "Remember [link=nm0001094] in [link=tt0062512]?") {
    relatedEntities {
        ... on Name { nameText { text } }
        ... on Title { titleText { text } }
    }
}

